# Embedded UI

No npm, no bundler, no interact.js. Pointer events in `app.js`.

Composer uses house designer chrome (`body.admin` tokens, file menu, settings modal). Cyan selection. Settings vs tools stay split: OBS/autostart in the modal, slot fields in the inspector. `PUT /api/slots/{id}` on pointerup, not per mousemove. Overlay is transparent; fade CSS only (~200ms).
